 "remarks": "Rare Riverside Opportunity with Endless Possibilities! Nestled on a quiet cul-de-sac in sought-after Riverside, this 4-bedroom, 3.5-bath home offers an exceptional opportunity to renovate, personalize, and create your dream home. The flexible floor plan features a welcoming living room with fireplace, formal dining room, eat-in kitchen, lower-level family room or home office, two primary suites, two additional bedrooms, and hardwood floors throughout. Enjoy the level backyard and stone patio, perfect for relaxing or entertaining. Neighborhood association access to the water for kayaking and canoeing is available for an annual fee. Conveniently located near schools, parks, shopping, dining, Metro-North, and I-95.",
